r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, February to March, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025, the middle had June to July at 164% of normal and February to March at just 48%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 30731 fell to 38% of normal that year.</p>"}
